WEBVTT

00:10:29.196 --> 00:10:33.556
But can we be better investors
by actually asking the communities,

00:10:33.556 --> 00:10:36.716
which we ask every time now,
before making an investment decision,

00:10:36.716 --> 00:10:37.916
"Would you use this?

00:10:37.916 --> 00:10:40.196
Is this something that you actually want?"

00:10:40.236 --> 00:10:42.156
It's what Maurice taught me, early on.

00:10:42.876 --> 00:10:44.516
You need to get out of the office,

00:10:44.556 --> 00:10:45.876
get on the ground

00:10:45.916 --> 00:10:48.436
and listen to what people really need.

00:10:48.836 --> 00:10:51.916
Technology can only bring
half the solution.

00:10:51.956 --> 00:10:54.276
The community brings the other half.

00:10:54.316 --> 00:10:57.076
And we have to fix this imbalance now

00:10:57.076 --> 00:10:58.916
if we want to fix climate change,

00:10:58.956 --> 00:11:00.156
and we do.